---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={`Now — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What Andrew Dobrow is working on and thinking about right now." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <h1>Now</h1>
        <p>What I'm up to lately. <span class="updated">Updated October 30, 2026.</span></p>
      </header>

<h2>In General</h2>
      <article class="prose now-content">
        <p>The weeks are short, but the days are long. I've generally been hyperfocused on building and improving Treasure Coast Today. My sister is coming to visit for a week or so, and she's leaving behind our old family dog due to unfortunate circumstances up in Jersey. But yay! New dog child!</p>

        <h2>Currently building</h2>
        <p><strong><a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a></strong> — The local news site I started in June 2026. Most days involve some combination of editorial work, improving the technology behind it, iterating on bugs, and finding new ways to reach readers and support the business.</p>
        <p><strong>The Treasure Coast Today iPhone app</strong> — Making local news easier to read and discover on a phone, with a better native experience. Currently waiting on Apple approval.</p>

        <h2>Currently focused on</h2>
        <p>Building multiple revenue streams for Treasure Coast Today. Actively reaching out to local businesses for sponsored partnerships. Tweaking this blog and joining webrings!</p>

        <h2>Outside the browser</h2>
        <p>Preparing for my sister to visit, which means lots of cleaning. Hoping and praying that my dog gets along with our old family dog, who will be joining my sister for the visit.</p>

        <h2>Reading</h2>
        <p><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/45032.Mansfield_Park">Mansfield Park</a> by Jane Austin</p>

        <p class="now-explainer">This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/now page</a>: a simple, periodically updated answer to “what are you up to these days?”</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
.updated { white-space: nowrap; color: #87918b; font-size: .84rem; }
.now-content strong { font-weight: 700; }
.now-explainer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 40px !important; padding-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; }
</style>
